  "bout_order_known": false,
  "description": "Single-elimination championship bracket. 2nd and 3rd are decided afterwards by Bergman wrestle-backs: only wrestlers who lost to the champion may wrestle for 2nd (earliest loser first, rounds WB2_*), the survivor meets the finals loser in the \"2nd\" bout; then the loser of that bout meets anyone who lost to the 2nd-place winner for 3rd (rounds WB3_*, \"3rd\"). A place can be awarded with no bout (method \"automatic\"). There is no drawn consolation sheet."
 },
